  "contract": [
    "Spirit Volley 504582 is a ranged-class Shadow attack in original Spell.dbc (DmgClass 3, SchoolMask 32).",
    "Its raw 1800 ms cast-time entry 23 gains the normal 500 ms ranged preparation before haste. The fixture",
    "supplies and observes ranged hit rating because spell-hit rating does not remove its native ranged miss",
    "roll. Removing ready buff 505158 after 100 ms must leave the actual Volley cast in progress; it then",
    "dispatches without a cast failure and damages the enemy. A second ordinary cast consumes its ready buff",
    "and also deals damage. Reclamation 572345 stays known. Preserve the original six-second damage deadline",
    "and ordinary cast/buff handling."
  ],
